{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Eye of Darkness</i></strong><i>\u00a0is a student\u2011made, completely </i><strong><i>free to play</i></strong><i>, game. </i><br><i> If you want to support us, join our community discord and give us feedback.</i><br><i>Thank you</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Eye of Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">is a survivor rogue-lite game with a focus on exploration in which you take on the role of a cultist trying to summon the Eye of Darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The forces of Light and Darkness have been locked in an eternal struggle for ultimate power. For eons, the Light has suppressed the Darkness, imprisoning the Eye of Darkness to maintain its dominance. Under the Light\u2019s rule, humanity lives under strict laws and rigid hierarchies, to suppress heresy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But now, a cult devoted to the Darkness sees an opportunity\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Features</u></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010820/extras/6cbd66a4fc1e880ad85ae31d39a9637a.poster.avif?t=1758814323\" width=131 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010820/extras/6cbd66a4fc1e880ad85ae31d39a9637a.webm?t=1758814323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The darkness sends forth a cultist to collect the ancient artifacts needed to awaken the Eye of Darkness. At first, only three artifacts are required, but with each successful run, the Eye of Darkness demands more. However, the time limit of 15 minutes remains unchanged\u2014how many artifacts can you collect while battling the relentless forces of Light?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010820/extras/2b9f72dca0f54d3a6df663c9fd44cd03.avif?t=1758814323\" width=302 height=216 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Explore</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Venture into an atmospheric world that is newly generated with every run.  </i><br><i>Discover unique locations, NPC's, and treasure spots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010820/extras/239df5174015df1b510ae0ba36478de2.poster.avif?t=1758814323\" width=990 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010820/extras/239df5174015df1b510ae0ba36478de2.webm?t=1758814323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010820/extras/239df5174015df1b510ae0ba36478de2.mp4?t=1758814323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Tactical combat</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Find five different NPCs, each granting you their unique spells. Combine their powers tactically and upgrade them using the souls of your enemies to achieve your ultimate goal.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010820/extras/b95a810a67c363609ec6d43e97a64785.avif?t=1758814323\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Rogue lite </i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Each run is limited to a maximum of 15 minutes. If you manage to collect all required artifacts, you are rewarded with a special upgrade. Even if you fail, the books you\u2019ve found can be used in the Arcanum to permanently enhance your stats.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010820?t=1758814323","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010820?t=1758814323","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010820/2787dbb82495a3d93128e65cb8d0dd20967870c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758814323","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010820/2787dbb82495a3d93128e65cb8d0dd20967870c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758814323","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Eye of Darkness</i></strong><i>\u00a0is a student\u2011made, completely </i><strong><i>free to play</i></strong><i>, game. </i><br><i> If you want to support us, join our community discord and give us feedback.</i><br><i>Thank you</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Eye of Darkness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: cen